# Build context exclusions for the Scopewatch image.
#
# The context is the REPO ROOT, so every pattern here is written relative to the
# repo root and uses **/ to match at any depth.
#
# Note on where this file has to live: with `-f products/scopewatch/Dockerfile .`
# BuildKit reads `products/scopewatch/Dockerfile.dockerignore` first and falls
# back to a `.dockerignore` at the context root - it never reads this path. The
# sibling Dockerfile.dockerignore is the copy that takes effect; this one holds
# the same list so the exclusions are findable under the name people look for.

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/docs/deck
